    "identifier": "hyuga-mountain-crusher",
    "description": "<p>An advanced and amplified version of the Vacuum Palm. All Creatures in range must make a Constitution saving throw, taking 6d6 force damage on a failed save, being pushed back 15 feet, and lose their reaction until the beginning of their turns on a failed save.</p>\n<p>On a successful save, they instead take half damage with no additional effects.</p>\n<p>Eight Trigram. This blast of chakra is devastating to everyone on the receiving end. Creatures who failed their save gain 2 ranks of Weakened.</p>\n<p>At Higher Ranks: For each rank you cast this jutsu above B-Rank, increase the cost of this jutsu by 3, damage by 1d6, and size of the cone by +5 feet.</p>",
